s February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 48% of normal in July to August and 59% in August to September. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids. All 3 grids had their driest year in 2007, with grid 19677 at 69%.</p>"}
